{"id":"wb-8-440","name":"蒙自玉皇阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"蒙自玉皇閣","text":"蒙自玉皇阁，位于中华人民共和国云南省红河哈尼族彝族自治州蒙自市承恩街，始建于明万历六年（1578年）。东西两阁建于清雍正时期。建阳会馆中殿位于玉皇阁背后，建于清乾隆三十五年（1770年）。中殿西侧为县衙大堂，建于清康熙年间。整片玉皇阁古建筑群于2019年被列为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%92%99%E8%87%AA%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E9%96%A3","revisionId":92852825,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92852825","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/969699243e2ea03446bb4428.jpg","title":"Yuhuang_Pavilion,_Mengzi.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yuhuang_Pavilion,_Mengzi.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/Yuhuang_Pavilion%2C_Mengzi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"鹿苑","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​蒙自玉皇阁，市佛教协会驻地","width":320,"height":218}}